sequenceDiagram
  participant U as operator
  participant C as wsm irc enable
  participant P as provision
  participant E as ergo (child)
  participant D as wsm irc daemon
  participant B as bot

  U->>C: wsm irc enable <ws>
  C->>P: preflight (ergo on PATH, port free, tls if remote)
  P->>P: allocate ports, write profile.yaml
  P->>P: render ergo.yaml (oper hash, api token, listeners)
  P->>P: ergo mkcerts (if remote && no cert)
  P->>P: ergo initdb
  C->>D: spawn detached (setsid), wait pidfile
  D->>E: spawn ergo run --conf, wait /v1/status
  D->>P: reconcile()
  P->>E: POST /v1/ns/saregister per member (+ bot)
  P->>P: write secrets.yaml (0600)
  D->>B: connect, SASL PLAIN, OPER
  B->>E: JOIN #ws → CS REGISTER → CS SET/TOPIC → AMODE per grant
  B->>E: repeat per channel template
  D->>B: capture loop (message-tags, account-tag, msgid)
  B-->>D: PRIVMSG → RecordEvent(interaction.message)
  C-->>U: {status: running, url, channels, members}
